text: ['({T}: Add {B}.)', '({T}: Add {G}.)', '({T}: Add {R}.)', '({T}: Add {U}.)', '({T}: Add {W}.)', 'All creatures get -4/-4 until end of turn.', 'As an additional cost to cast this spell, discard a card.\nDraw two cards.', 'As an additional cost to cast this spell, sacrifice a creature.\nDestroy target creature.', 'Attacking creatures get -2/-0 until end of turn.\nDraw a card.', 'Bombard deals 4 damage to target creature.', 'Create two 1/1 red Goblin creature tokens.', 'Create two 2/2 white Knight creature tokens with vigilance.', 'Creatures you control get +2/+1 until end of turn.', 'Creatures you control get +2/+2 and gain trample until end of turn.', 'Creatures you control with flying get +1/+1.', 'Destroy target attacking creature.\nDraw a card.', "Destroy target non-Zombie creature. It can't be regenerated. Return up to one target Zombie card from your graveyard to your hand.", 'Each opponent loses 1 life for each creature you control.', "Enchant creature\nWhen Claustrophobia enters the battlefield, tap enchanted creature.\nEnchanted creature doesn't untap during its controller's untap step.", 'Flying', 'Flying\nWhen Inspired Sphinx enters the battlefield, draw cards equal to the number of opponents you have.\n{3}{U}: Create a 1/1 colorless Thopter artifact creature token with flying.', "Flying\nWhen Pilgrim's Eye enters the battlefield, you may search your library for a basic land card, reveal it, put it into your hand, then shuffle.", 'Flying\nWhen Subjugator Angel enters the battlefield, tap all creatures your opponents control.', 'Flying\nWhenever you cast a noncreature spell, creatures you control get +1/+1 until end of turn.', 'Flying\n{2}{U}, Discard two cards: Return Advanced Stitchwing from your graveyard to the battlefield tapped.', 'Flying, haste', 'Flying, lifelink\nWhen Militant Angel enters the battlefield, create a number of 2/2 white Knight creature tokens with vigilance equal to the number of opponents you attacked this turn.', 'Flying, vigilance', 'Flying, vigilance, lifelink', 'Green creature spells you cast cost {1} less to cast.\nWhenever you cast a creature spell, target creature you control gets +2/+2 and gains trample until end of turn.', 'Lifelink', 'Look at the top four cards of your library. You may reveal a creature or land card from among them and put it into your hand. Put the rest on the bottom of your library in any order.', 'Menace\nWhen Rot Hulk enters the battlefield, return up to X target Zombie cards from your graveyard to the battlefield, where X is the number of opponents you have.', 'Nontoken creatures you control get +1/+1 and have vigilance.', 'Other Zombies you control get +1/+1.\n{1}{B}, {T}: All Zombies gain menace until end of turn.', 'Other creatures you control get +1/+1.', 'Prevent all combat damage that would be dealt to Everdawn Champion.', 'Rolling Thunder deals X damage divided as you choose among any number of targets.', "Scry 5, then reveal the top card of your library. If it's a creature card, you draw cards equal to its power and you gain life equal to its toughness.", 'This spell costs {1} less to cast for each opponent you have.\nTrample\nWhen Avatar of Growth enters the battlefield, each player searches their library for up to two basic land cards, puts them onto the battlefield, then shuffles.', 'This spell costs {X} less to cast, where X is the total power of creatures you control.\nTrample', 'When Eager Construct enters the battlefield, each player may scry 1. (To scry 1, look at the top card of your library, then you may put that card on the bottom of your library.)', 'When Filigree Familiar enters the battlefield, you gain 2 life.\nWhen Filigree Familiar dies, draw a card.', 'When Fleshbag Marauder enters the battlefield, each player sacrifices a creature.', 'When Goblin Goliath enters the battlefield, create a number of 1/1 red Goblin creature tokens equal to the number of opponents you have.\n{3}{R}, {T}: If a source you control would deal damage to an opponent this turn, it deals double that damage to that player instead.', 'When Inspiring Captain enters the battlefield, creatures you control get +1/+1 until end of turn.', "When Seismic Elemental enters the battlefield, creatures without flying can't block this turn.", 'When Siege-Gang Commander enters the battlefield, create three 1/1 red Goblin creature tokens.\n{1}{R}, Sacrifice a Goblin: Siege-Gang Commander deals 2 damage to any target.', 'When Tattered Mummy dies, each opponent loses 2 life.', "When Whirler Rogue enters the battlefield, create two 1/1 colorless Thopter artifact creature tokens with flying.\nTap two untapped artifacts you control: Target creature can't be blocked this turn.", 'Whenever Howling Golem attacks or blocks, each player draws a card.', 'Whenever Zulaport Cutthroat or another creature you control dies, each opponent loses 1 life and you gain 1 life.', "You may pay {3}{U} and tap an untapped artifact you control rather than pay this spell's mana cost.\nFlying", "Zombies you control get +1/+1.\nWhen Liliana's Mastery enters the battlefield, create two 2/2 black Zombie creature tokens.", '{1}, Sacrifice Thrashing Brontodon: Destroy target artifact or enchantment.', '{2}, Sacrifice a creature: Draw a card.', '{2}, {T}: Tap target creature.', '{3}{G}: Put a +1/+1 counter on Jungle Delver.', '{3}{R}: Gain control of target creature an opponent controls until end of turn. Untap that creature. It gains haste until end of turn. Activate only as a sorcery.', '{3}{R}: Welder Automaton deals 1 damage to each opponent.', '{T}: Add one mana of any color.', '{T}: Add {G}.', '{T}: Target player draws a card, then discards a card.']
